<BRK/>
<OLI>Minimum number of online compartments ____<HL1>4</HL1>____</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Maximum net air-to-cloth ratio,<MET> L/s per sq meter</MET><ENG> acfm per sq ft</ENG> (at maximum continuous rating, including volume used for reverse air) [_____]</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Minimum system pressure drop,<MET> Pa</MET><ENG> inches WC</ENG> (from inlet flange to outlet flange) [_____]</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Maximum system pressure drop,<MET> Pa</MET><ENG> inches WC</ENG> (from inlet flange to outlet flange) [_____]</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Minimum individual hopper storage capacity, hours [_____]</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Minimum individual hopper storage capacity,<MET> cu m</MET><ENG> cu ft</ENG>[_____]</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Minimum hopper valley angle, degrees from horizontal ___55___</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
