<BRK/>
<OLI>Minimum permeability,<MET> L/s per sq m</MET><ENG> cfm per sq ft</ENG> (clean at <MET> 125 Pa</MET><ENG> 1/2 inch WC</ENG>) [_____]</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Minimum thickness,<MET> mm</MET><ENG> mil</ENG> [_____]</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Minimum M.I.T. flex (warp direction), cycles [_____]</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Minimum M.I.T. flex (fill direction), cycles [_____]</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Minimum count, ends per<MET> 25 mm</MET><ENG> inch</ENG> by picks per<MET> 25 mm</MET><ENG> inch</ENG> [_____]</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Minimum fabric weight,<MET> 2894 g per sq m</MET><ENG> 9.5 oz per sq ft</ENG></OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Minimum bursting strength,<MET> kPa</MET><ENG> psi</ENG> [_____]</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/></SPT>
][<SPT><TTL>Bags--Pulse Jet Cleaning System</TTL><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
<OLI>Maximum bag diameter,<MET> 152 mm</MET><ENG> 6 inches</ENG></OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Maximum bag length,<MET> 4.25 m</MET><ENG> 14 feet</ENG></OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
