<BRK/>
<OLI>Minimum tensile strength (fill direction),<MET> kPa</MET><ENG> psi</ENG> [_____]</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Minimum yarn weight,<MET> g per sq m</MET><ENG> oz per sq yd</ENG> [_____]</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
